function offenseRoundStart(){for(const f of groupActors())if(getSt(f,'眩晕')&&!getSt(f,'霸体')&&!getSt(f,'强韧')){offenseClearRhythm(f);if(f.offenseV1)f.offenseV1.stages={};}}
function statusBaseCheckEnd(f){const out=offenseBaseCheckEnd(f);if(over)for(const f of groupActors())f.offenseV1=null;return out;}
function offenseProjectBegin(f,m,targets,paid,at){if(!offenseMain(m,f)||!offenseEntries(f).length||paid.nai+paid.neili<=0)return null;const percent=offensePercentQuote(f,m),payment={...paid,base:paid.offenseBase||offenseBaseQuote(f,m),...(percent&&paid.neili>=percent.total?{percent}:{})},c=offenseBegin(f,m,targets,payment,at,true);f.offenseProjection={key:offenseKey(m),bonuses:c.bonuses};return c;}
